TERMS & CONDITIONS
- Warranty effective only for original buyers, and it is necessary for VATTI products buy only from authorized dealers;
- For warranty claim, it is necessary to fill up e-warranty properly and completely time of purchase;
- Any kind of VATTI product warranty claim based on manufacture defect or poor workmanship under the normal use;
- Product warranty period and maintenance are as per VATTI malaysia policy;
- In case of providing home service, visit charges will be applicable as per policy;
Warranty Period
- 2 years for cooker hood, cooker hob, combi oven built in oven and built in steam oven.
- Lifetime warranty for cooker hob glasstop.
- 10 years warranty for all models cooker hood motor.
Those who fall into one of the following situations are not covered by the free maintenance:
- Damage caused by improper use;
- Damage caused by non-VATTI service outlet installation, disassembly and maintenance;
- Cannot provide warranty card or valid purchase certificate, or the warranty card and valid certificate have been altered.
- The product model and product serial number on the warranty card or valid purchase certificate do not match the product model and serial number being repaired.
- Electric short circuit, voltage fluctuation, poor wiring, wrong use, miss parts, accidental damage and force majeure;
- Products that exceed the warranty period;
If the product fails out of the warranty period, VATTI after-sales outlets will also provide you with warm, thoughtful and timely paid services as per policy.
